# How a Bad Blood round ends

cmu-bad-blood-end-marines-win = The Bad Blood clan is broken: its Leader is gone and its Lodge has fallen.
cmu-bad-blood-end-clan-wipe = The Bad Blood clan has been wiped out.
cmu-bad-blood-end-departure = The Bad Blood clan has left with its trophies. Its Lodge stood to the end.
cmu-bad-blood-end-last-stand = The clan has no one left on the ground. A last squad is called to the Lodge.

# The Ship Call-In

cmu-bad-blood-ship-called-clan = The Lodge has called the clan ship. It arrives in { $minutes } minutes. Hold the Lodge.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-called-marines = ARES orbital tracking: an unidentified vessel is inbound on the hunters' signal, arriving in { $minutes } minutes. The signal traces to the hunters' Lodge, now marked on the tactical map.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-turned-back-clan = The Lodge has fallen. The clan ship has turned back.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-turned-back-marines = The Yautja Lodge is destroyed. Their clan ship has turned back.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-arrived-clan = The clan ship is in orbit. Hunters will join you for as long as the Lodge stands and the clan has a Leader. Hold the Lodge for { $minutes } minutes and the clan leaves with its trophies.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-arrived-marines = ARES orbital tracking: the Yautja clan vessel has entered orbit. Drop signatures are converging on the hunters' Lodge. Projected departure in { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departure-clan = The clan ship leaves in { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }. Hold the Lodge.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departure-marines = ARES orbital tracking: the Yautja vessel's departure window closes in { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departure-paused-clan = The Lodge has fallen. The clan ship waits, with { $minutes } minutes left, until a Lodge stands again.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departure-paused-marines = ARES orbital tracking: the Lodge's signal is gone. The Yautja vessel is holding orbit with { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    } left on its departure window.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departure-resumed-clan = A Lodge stands again. The clan ship leaves in { $minutes } minutes.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departure-resumed-marines = ARES orbital tracking: a new hunter signal is up on the surface. The Yautja vessel's departure window resumes with { $minutes } minutes left.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departed-clan = The clan ship takes you home with your trophies.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-departed-marines = The Yautja clan ship has left orbit with its hunters.

# FLOW-504: the early warning, heard only through a comms tower that is On
cmu-bad-blood-ship-signal-marines = The colony comms tower is picking up unknown vessel signals answering the hunters' emitters. At this rate a ship is called in about { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }.
cmu-bad-blood-ship-signal-lost-marines = The unknown vessel signals have gone quiet. The Yautja ship call has been broken.
